Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.09,0:00:08.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　源源不绝的热情{\fad(500,00)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:13.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着怦然心动的未来  伸出双手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:19.43,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够放出光芒　IT'S WONDERLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:25.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未来那无法预测的黑夜  震撼着你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:33.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法相信任何东西  你充耳不闻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你相遇的瞬间  我找到了真正的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:49.37,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不自觉的温柔呈现在面前  把我们唤醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.81,0:00:56.40,OP2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　不会再迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:01:06.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要构筑起跟你在一起的未来  就能飞向任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.14,0:01:11.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,CHANGE MY MIND　源源不绝的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:16.36,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着未知的明天  张开双翼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:23.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够展翅飞翔　IT'S WONDERLAND{\fad(0000,480)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:18.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们 在生命的旅程中{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.93,0:22:24.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渐渐地 失去所有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.87,0:22:30.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:37.42,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.26,0:22:47.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今在那深深的丛林中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:53.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也一定埋藏着 被丢弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:59.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若能把握时光的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:06.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许 能再次飞翔{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:14.69,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将彷徨着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:21.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生存下去 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.32,0:23:26.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:33.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能捡回一条命就算万幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我们还是比较适合拿锄头而不是刀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为我要没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下就能活着回村子了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这多亏了那位巫女大人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太走运了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与平他醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:01:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要振作点啊 与平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女大人的药果然有效
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.76,0:02:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与平醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.94,0:02:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿鬼还在觊觎这个男人的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女大人 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 他已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概明天就能起来走动了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:36.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫桔梗的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在这座寺里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你对在战争中受伤的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是我方或敌营的人 都会帮他们疗伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还用神奇的法术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇迹般救活很多生命垂危的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.04,0:02:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是什么神奇的法术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是对治疗伤口有点心得罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有话到城堡里再说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陷入邪气中的桔梗与犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.51,0:03:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们人见家的主公 荫刀大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生来就体弱多病
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:17.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久前先主去世
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由他继承了城主之位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他的身体最近越来越差
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管如此 别说医师了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他连家臣都不被允许靠近半步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以 谁都不能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把能够治好荫刀大人的巫女带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是主公说不准任何人进去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公不愿意见任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座城堡是怎么回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股邪气是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂…喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:03:56.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个男人发出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.06,0:04:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从他的身上完全感觉不到生气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像除了头以外都死了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公 实在是很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.61,0:04:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人不顾我们阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说能够治愈疾病 就擅自闯入
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:21.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都退下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:33.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗还活着…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50年前 被我设计害死的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:42.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本应带着四魂之玉死去的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:47.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人…到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事？这可太惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边也不行 全部都枯了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又没有遇上干旱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一个月突然全枯了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.62,0:05:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:10.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像血一样鲜红
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们说妖怪的残骸从天而降啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 看起来真的好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田地全都被污染了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.15,0:05:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是田地而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老人和小孩这些体弱的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个接一个倒下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近一定有一个强烈邪气的源头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 又要帮人家除妖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这么有空去干这些吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得快点去找奈落 找奈落啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:05:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你道歉 我也绝对不会原谅你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:02.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提到奈落那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他上次中戈薇的那一箭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该已经受了很重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是以奈落的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,短时间之内
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他恐怕是无法复原的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们连谢礼钱都收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下非得帮人家不可了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时侯收的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 谁叫你收的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是要收礼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也应该做完事再收才对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后才收的话都不会给多的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小子…势利眼臭和尚！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:37.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来邪气的源头无疑就是那座山了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得除了奈落没有妖怪能放出这么强的邪气了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了奈落…是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家主公的病情如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 恐怕连我也束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.98,0:07:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我知道主公的病情不轻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到连你都束手无策啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:12.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一个平凡的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在抱歉 我就此告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公命令我们不能让你离开城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就暂时留在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本应死去的桔梗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要杀她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待查清她底细之后也不迟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:42.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今夜我终于如愿以偿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到了一个有趣的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为瘴气的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里根本寸草不生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座山里到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这山洞怎么回事？邪气从是从洞里出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体还没有完全康复
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚和戈薇在这里等着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是除妖而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要大家一起进去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 好像你没什么大碍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好小心一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股邪气十分强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉到了 巨大的邪气之穴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把门打开 然后把弓箭找来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你要不要紧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘴气好像越来越强了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 戈薇你竟然一点事都没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 暂时还好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事…好像有东西想把我吸进去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个洞穴里到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉跟弥勒大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气越来越强了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你干什么 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.53,0:09:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是久经修行才只是如此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换成普通人类 早就没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪的…残骸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些妖怪缠斗在一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有上百只妖怪在这里厮杀过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.89,0:10:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,落在那村子里的一定就是这里的残骸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们为什么要这么做…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后剩下的那只妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:24.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体融合在一起了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我出不去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是只有最后获胜的妖怪才能活着离开这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.06,0:11:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来那里还有一只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我猜得没错的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样下去不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子就陪你打个爽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.15,0:12:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你不能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:14.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以你现在的身体 要是进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会撑不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.55,0:12:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你还是先离开这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再待在这里的话 对你的身体很不好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.67,0:12:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.27,0:12:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉在里面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:49.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…戈薇 那个巫女就是桔梗对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要追过去吗？戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝你陪在珊瑚身边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 刚才那个人是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道为什么桔梗会到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.87,0:13:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过里面肯定发生了不好的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带云母去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身体里的死魂想冲出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被这洞穴中的邪气所吸引吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气之外还能感觉到一股气息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:30.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股气息是…城里那个男人的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就要了断你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这家伙的伤复原了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.25,0:13:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快把刀收起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要跟它战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不战斗难道要我坐以待毙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听我说 这是所谓的“巫蛊之术”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟“蛊毒”的作法是一模一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“巫蛊之术”？“蛊毒”？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所谓的“巫蛊之术”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是把毒虫 蜥蜴之类的放在一个容器中互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后活下来的一只就成为“蛊毒”的咒术
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在说这些也没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:24.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.81,0:14:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能活着离开这里的只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能跟它拼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么下去就不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不把这里的咒术解除的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉就会…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.94,0:14:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔…桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死魂…在流走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗…这股邪气是…“蛊毒”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.11,0:15:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被我的咒术封在山洞中的无数妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在里面互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,获胜存活的最后一只
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它才会…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.65,0:16:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为我奈落新的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.94,0:16:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？四魂的气息…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这块四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:43.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是另外一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外一个拥有 四魂碎片的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为吸收了桔梗的死魂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的邪气越来越强了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:16:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒大人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 你振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒大人 这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:12.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方被施了“巫蛊之术”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赶快阻止犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样下去他会跟妖怪融合的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,融合？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到四魂碎片的气息了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…这是圈套？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这邪气的强度 应该没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奈落设下的圈套
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.27,0:17:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为我的血肉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你…碰桔梗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要太激动 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能不激动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.56,0:17:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑 我一定要保护桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要保护桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇小姐 你要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把桔梗的身体拉上来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会为了保护桔梗而继续战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉绝对无法坐视桔梗不管
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我有点不甘心…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了？站得起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你跑进来 犬夜叉完全失去了理智
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是为了救你才这么拼命的 你却…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要杀它啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:37.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印解除了 邪气开始往外面冲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:49.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是桔梗她…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.17,0:20:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被戈薇打碎的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.24,0:20:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落为了制造新的身躯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:43.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用了“巫蛊之术”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们似乎被山里的邪气所吸引
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:49.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闯入了我封印的洞穴中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也可以成为我身体的一部分的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.72,0:21:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个女人把封印解除了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过托她的福我能顺利取得新的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.00,0:21:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗之所以会破坏封印
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是因为她要保护犬夜叉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是50年前追随你死去的桔梗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿开你的脏手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不准你碰桔梗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,畜牲…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,畜牲！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果桔梗真的想救犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.41,0:21:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其破坏封印
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:22:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如用箭射穿妖怪“蛊毒”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗却破坏了封印
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.22,0:22:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我奈落得到了全新的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.41,0:23:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落得到了全新的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更加强大的妖力袭向了我们心中的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,思念着桔梗的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:23:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受风穴之苦的弥勒大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:24:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为弟弟琥珀的幻影而彷徨的珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.33,0:24:03.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 你愿意帮我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们收集到现在的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.47,0:24:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要那些碎片想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.10,0:24:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.50,0:24:13.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被囚禁的桔梗与奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.81,0:24:19.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.31,0:25:20.41,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫蛊之术中最后残存的妖怪{\pos(292,288)}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.31,0:25:20.41,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被奈落用来制造新的身躯{\pos(283,414)}
